1600 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I'm really glad you're feeling better now. I had no idea the King of\the North could use magic...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1610 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Can a spell truly kill a man? I definitely was in pain, but I thought it\was just another one of my nightmares.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1620 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Some spells are similar to hypnosis, but they can be cast on\someone from a distance. They require great concentration, so the King\of the North must be spent right now.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
